<svg class="sk" viewBox="0 0 600 440" preserveAspectRatio="xMinYMin slice" role="img" aria-label="Sketch of the Thatpam landing page: a green announcement bar, the Tamil logo, a two-line hero headline reading Love what you learn, and an illustration of a video lesson">
